{"kind":"charness.bounded_review.v1","lens":"issue-resolution: resolution/recurrence and per-target behavioral observations","packet_sha256":"0b97eb1f4917e191aa88106ff34716402bfed21283230c8fb312a84b839fa561","reviewed_input_identity_sha256":"41528b962ca4523714d201ba7e58eb0ee62273a013596e9a74863cb136db8cdd","verdict":"pass","target_observations":[{"target":"corca-ai/charness#816","verdict":"pass","summary":"The reviewed contents repair the abnormal-exit WIP behavior and provide mapped recurrence protection for out-of-scope-only, empty, and mixed-change cases.","evidence":["scripts/task_run/task_run.py refreshes scope specs, derives changed paths from the candidate carrier, filters them through _paths_in_scopes, and calls _commit_wip_candidate only when the scoped set is non-empty.","When no scoped paths exist, scripts/task_run/task_run.py records candidate commit status \"skipped\" with reason \"no scoped changes: no WIP candidate commit created\" and does not advance target_head.","scripts/task_run/task_run_git.py requires an explicit paths sequence in _commit_wip_candidate and delegates without allow_empty, so its commit command cannot include --allow-empty.","scripts/task_run/task_run_completion_next_step.py reports timed-out, non-committed candidates as having no WIP candidate commit, matching the skipped outcome.","tests/charness_cli/test_task_run.py contains three focused regressions: test_timeout_with_only_out_of_scope_change_creates_no_wip_commit, test_timeout_with_no_changes_creates_no_wip_commit, and test_timeout_with_scoped_change_commits_only_scoped_paths.","The mixed-case test verifies that only module.py is committed while probe.md remains dirty; the out-of-scope-only and empty tests verify HEAD remains at base and the commit record is skipped."]}],"findings":[],"counterweight_triage":[{"concern":"The timed-out next-step branch treats every non-committed candidate as having no scoped changes.","bin":"not-blocking-in-reviewed-flow","disposition":"The abnormal-exit commit failure path returns a terminal result before completion rendering, while the supplied successful non-committed path is the explicit zero-scoped-change skipped record."},{"concern":"The packet supplies test contents but no test-execution receipt.","bin":"bounded-non-claim","disposition":"The caller's pass condition asks whether the repair and regression-test mapping are present in these contents; both are present. Runtime execution is not inferred."}],"next_move":"Accept the issue-resolution contents; run the focused task-run tests through the owning verification workflow before integration if execution evidence is required.","non_claims":["No tests or validators were executed as part of this read-only semantic review.","This verdict does not assess files outside the four identity-bound reviewed paths.","This verdict does not claim goal-bound evidence; the supplied lineage is explicitly not-goal-bound."]}
